WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:01.480
Now in the army.

00:02.360 --> 00:07.320
Most are our trusted men Chen Ying wants to kill me it's not that easy.

00:07.440 --> 00:12.000
Now Prince Ning has controlled the court situation has all the advantages.

00:12.480 --> 00:18.080
If I raise troops now it's disloyalty using the northern expedition to march south.

00:18.160 --> 00:20.960
It's unjust brothers fighting.

00:22.160 --> 00:27.480
Is even unfilial an army without just cause how can it win?

00:27.560 --> 00:29.840
Your Highness Your Highness, Your Highness.

00:31.680 --> 00:35.693
My mind is made up this matter, speak no more of it.

00:40.440 --> 00:45.400
Since Lord Xie has come stay with me in the army zhu Yuanzhi.

00:46.080 --> 00:49.560
Tomorrow you come with me to apologize with bared back.

00:51.000 --> 01:05.000
Half a year later, a catastrophic fire suddenly broke out in the Prince of Jin's estate. More than forty souls residing within all tragically perished.

01:08.000 --> 01:17.500
Panic gripped court officials. Seizing this opportunity, Prince Ning carried out a sweeping purge, eradicating all dissent from Great Xuan's imperial court.

